+        /**
+         * Validates that the output path does not attempt path traversal.
+         * Uses canonical path comparison to handle all edge cases including
+         * encoded sequences, different path separators, and symbolic links.
+         *
+         * @param target target file path
+         * @throws SecurityException if path traversal is detected
